Traceability & Logistics Platform
🎯 Overview
A React-based platform for real-time tracking and commodity management. Designed for supply chain professionals, it integrates multiple sectors (palm oil, beverages, agriculture, aquaculture, livestock, personal care) with live shipment tracking and inventory visibility.

🚀 Features
Categories Grid: Manage commodities by sector with modular UI components.

Live Tracking: Monitor shipments in real time using WebSockets or GraphQL subscriptions.

Product List: Inventory and availability with CRUD operations.

Commodity Stats: Overview dashboard with charts and KPIs.

📊 Demo Data
Sample inserts are provided in query.sql:

Huile de Palme RSPO

Jus de Mangue

Tilapia

Savon Kifebe

This dataset illustrates multi-sector commodity management and can be extended for custom demos.

🔄 CI/CD Pipeline
Implemented with CircleCI + Vercel:

Install dependencies

bash
npm ci
Build

bash
npm run build
Test

bash
npm test -- --coverage
Deploy

bash
vercel --token $VERCEL_TOKEN
🔐 Environment Variables
Configured in CircleCI project settings:

VERCEL_TOKEN → Deployment authentication

DB_URL → Postgres connection string

